// file holding the mark redrawn as filled chevrons and Compound Health as fourteen letter
// paths. Both halves live here so the nav, the footer and anything else draw from one source.
//
// Two things are deliberate. The delivered #18181B is dropped for currentColor, or the lockup
// could not invert over the hero. And each viewBox is tight to its own ink, taken from the
// delivered file with getBBox rather than by eye, so a size set on either half is the size of
// the drawing and not of the whitespace around it. The proportion between the two, for anyone
// setting both in one lockup, is 342.23 of mark to a 280.4 wordmark box with 104.68 between.
